<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome Onboard | Invoicegen</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 180px;
        }
        .hero img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333333;
        }
        p {
            color: #666666;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #007bff;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #0056b3;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- Hero Image -->
        <div class="hero">
            <img src="{{domain}}/staticfiles/email_assets/emailTemplateBanner.png" alt="Welcome to Invoicegen">
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Welcome Onboard, {{name}}!</h1>
            <p>We're excited to have you at <strong>Invoicegen</strong>—your go-to platform for seamless invoicing.</p>
            <p>You are now verified and can start generating invoices, managing payments, and more.</p>
            <p>Click below to access your dashboard and start exploring.</p>
            <a href="{{link}}" class="btn">Go to Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to <a href="mailto:support@invoicegen.com">contact our support team</a>.</p>
            <p>Best regards, <br> The Invoicegen Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
